## Phase 1: Setup (Shared Infrastructure)

**Purpose**: Install dependencies and configure storage for bulk verification

- [ ] T001 Install backend dependencies: `npm install csv-parse xlsx csv-stringify @aws-sdk/client-s3 @aws-sdk/s3-request-presigner` in backend/
- [ ] T002 [P] Configure DigitalOcean Spaces environment variables in backend/.env (SPACES_ENDPOINT, SPACES_REGION, SPACES_ACCESS_KEY, SPACES_SECRET_KEY, SPACES_BUCKET)
- [ ] T003 [P] Add bulk verification settings to backend/.env (BULK_MAX_FILE_SIZE_MB=10, BULK_MAX_EMAILS_PER_JOB=100000, BULK_BATCH_SIZE=100, BULK_RESULT_RETENTION_DAYS=14)
- [ ] T004 [P] Configure Spaces lifecycle policy for 14-day auto-deletion of results/ prefix in DigitalOcean control panel
- [ ] T005 [P] Install frontend dependencies: `npm install react-dropzone` in /Users/prabhakaranr/Documents/dev/BotCompany/EmailVerify-Frontend/

